Egocentric? It *might* be egocentric if I were to just start using 
established words in new ways without telling anyone, but bringing it up 
for community discussion is the very opposite of egocentric.
Besides, according to CLL 9.1 <http://lojban.github.io/cll/9/1/>:

> The place structures of brivla are not absolutely stable aspects of the 
> language. The work done so far has attempted to establish a basic place 
> structure on which all users can, at first, agree. In the light of actual 
> experience with the individual selbri of the language, there will 
> inevitably be some degree of change to the brivla place structures.
>

